# Never upload the scans.
#
# A Git-based deploy cannot see any of this -- it is all gitignored -- so this
# file is for the other path: `vercel` run from the project root uploads the
# working tree as it stands. That would put the diary's images, and the index
# that maps them, onto a CDN. The mistake is one command long and deleting the
# deployment afterwards does not unsend the bytes.
images/
src/lib/manifest.generated.json

# Credentials, and the CLI's record of which project is linked.
.env
.env*.local
supabase/.temp/
supabase/.branches/
